# Version the recipe, not the render.
#
# The sources here (prompts, HTML compositions, mix scripts) are small and worth
# keeping - they are how a clip gets rebuilt. The outputs are 221MB, one of them
# is over GitHub's 50MB warning, and every one of them would be pulled on every
# clone and every Vercel build, permanently, because git history does not forget.
#
# If a specific render needs to be shared, upload it rather than committing it.
.build/
export/
hf/
audio/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.wav
*.mp3
*.png
